[43.363856, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2d  mints a duplicate session on every call, because its retry resumes\u001b[10X\r\n  from a checkpoint and never re-resolves. Only arm 2 shows that a\u001b[12X\r\n  duplicate launch was prevented. Do not present arm 1 on its own.\u001b[12X\u001b[5;78H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r--- arm: mid-execute ---\r\n    Worker killed mid-work; retry resumed from the checkpoint\u001b[17X\r\n    workflow : bead-orchestration/demo-city/worker-kill-demo/work-item-1\u001b[6X\r\n    activity : formula/demo-root/edit-file.author/g1\u001b[26X\u001b[10;78H\u001b[1K\r    session  : agent-session-1ecb4849\r\n    receipt  : status=completed outcome=completed\u001b[29X\u001b[12;78H\u001b[1K\r\n    [PASS] proof 1: the bound session identity did not change across attempts\u001b[1X\r\n           distinct session identities seen by the agent adapter = 1\u001b[10X\r\n    [PASS] proof 1: the work store recorded that same session\u001b[17X\r\n           store session matches the one the agent bound = True\u001b[15X\r\n    [PASS] proof 2: exactly one session was created for this work item and gen\u001b[18;78H\u001b[1K\reration\u001b[19;78H\u001b[1K\r           session creations = 1\r\n    [PASS] proof 2: exactly one session record exists on disk for that pair\u001b[3X\u001b[21;78H\u001b[1K\r           session records = 1\r\n    [PASS] proof 3: exactly one terminal receipt was written to the work store\r\n           receipts = 1, status = completed\u001b[35X\r\n    [PASS] proof 3: the agent session produced one terminal record, not two\u001b[3X\u001b[25;78H\u001b[1K\r           agent terminal records = 1\r\n    [PASS] proof 3: a completion carrying the stale claim token failed closed\u001b[1X\r\n           rejection = 'stale bead generation or claim token'\u001b[17X\r\n    [PASS] the retry ran under the same Activity identity\u001b[21X\r\n           activity identities in history = ['formula/demo-root/edit-file.auth\u001b[30;78H\u001b[1K\ror/g1']\r\n    [PASS] Temporal really did retry (attempt two or later finished the work)\u001b[1X\n\u001b[1K\r           final attempt = 2\r\n    [PASS] the workflow closed on its own terms\u001b[31X\u001b[34;78H\u001b[1K\r           status = Completed\r\n    [PASS] arm fact: the retry resumed from the checkpoint and never re-resolv\u001b[36;78H\u001b[1K\red\u001b[37;78H\u001b[1K\r           resolver calls = 1\r\n    [PASS] arm fact: the agent kept working after its Worker was killed\u001b[7X\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
